# `<predicate> of <undefined name>` raises, exactly like the VM's GET_NAME path
# (CASE(PREDICATE_NAME) calls rt_error(EK_UNDEFINED_NAME) when
# env_resolve_chain misses). Also unwitnessed until a blind review asked which
# fixture would red if the raise were replaced by `return 0`.
#
# The companion case — a name that IS a compiled function, so env-unbound in
# the AOT but bound in the VM — is t87, and must NOT raise.
observed is 2.0
observed is 3.0
print of "before"
q is converged of nosuchname
print of ("q " + (str of q))
